  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to channel spirits improves. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Power from Beyond.</strong> Once per turn, when you cast a Bard spell with a spell slot that deals damage or restores Hit Points, roll 1d6: you gain a bonus equal to the number rolled to one of the spell's damage rolls or to the total Hit Points it restores.</p><p><strong>Spiritual Manifestation.</strong> You always have @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSpiritGuar]{Spirit Guardians} prepared, and you can cast it once without a spell slot, regaining that use when you finish a Long Rest. Whenever you cast it, you can modify it so that the spirits also guard against worldly threats: you and your allies in its Emanation have Half Cover. Once you modify the spell this way, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
